+  BootShim/gzippedFD/DTB in Mu-sweet.img; no fastboot/flash command in CI.
+  Original iOS16 input parsed with NativePrelink's real parser (not only custom
+  inventory); board now records decoded kernel hash as prelink input pin.
+  No prelink tool/roots/addresses selected yet; source compatibility unqualified.
+
 - **UniXNU initial menu SUCCESS / exact sweet firmware CI staged:** generic
   menu CI39635176783 succeeded onba7bce9. Downloaded ARM64 EFI app/registrar
   to research/unixnu-ios16-out/menu; published SHA verification passed.
diff --git a/ports/UniXNU-sweet/board.toml b/ports/UniXNU-sweet/board.toml
index e5ebbe0..d2fa885 100644
--- a/ports/UniXNU-sweet/board.toml
+++ b/ports/UniXNU-sweet/board.toml
@@ -21,6 +21,10 @@ fetch = ["KernelCache", "DeviceTree", "StaticTrustCache"]
 [kernel]
 defconfig = "sweet_ios16_defconfig"
 
+[kernel.prelink]
+# Decoded ordinary ARM64 Mach-O from the selected 20H392 restore identity.
+kernelcache_sha256 = "2ec297bac95bcba01046fd0148e97e7e5885c05a6c18827f39f534ba375c1221"
+
 # No prelink addresses/roots, userdata LBAs or payload root UUID are borrowed
 # from sheng. Fill these from the selected iOS16 kernelcache and sweet GPT.
 
